{"name": "Ittzy Fearless", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Ittzy Fearless is all about slicing deftly through the chaos wielding your punches and special moves. At least this is what you tell yourself as you are yet again defeated in a comically avoidable way.  <br/>It probably looks something like this:   <br/> <br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"300\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149080/extras/269160873b2b327c37457cd92e53f62b.poster.avif?t=1780517996\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149080/extras/269160873b2b327c37457cd92e53f62b.webm?t=1780517996\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149080/extras/269160873b2b327c37457cd92e53f62b.mp4?t=1780517996\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Punch their projectiles back!\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0You might faceplant horribly and often. But! If you try again and make quick and smart use of your abilities, you may be able to use your enemies<strong>'</strong> own moves against them. <br/><br/>For instance, when enemies shoot projectiles at you, punch them back!<br/><br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"300\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149080/extras/b794e4a1f8a713dcd3d5c3bf97a5e554.poster.avif?t=1780517996\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149080/extras/b794e4a1f8a713dcd3d5c3bf97a5e554.webm?t=1780517996\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149080/extras/b794e4a1f8a713dcd3d5c3bf97a5e554.mp4?t=1780517996\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><br/>Or clear enemies in satisfying chain-reactions.<br/><br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"300\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149080/extras/d819f520ca9d02e65756a10914e57e58.poster.avif?t=1780517996\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149080/extras/d819f520ca9d02e65756a10914e57e58.webm?t=1780517996\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149080/extras/d819f520ca9d02e65756a10914e57e58.mp4?t=1780517996\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Fire yourself up</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Charge up as you land your punches, and unleash fire in special attacks.   <br/><br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"300\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149080/extras/ba7a345ce5e85fb6b8591cd2d8c1ae69.poster.avif?t=1780517996\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149080/extras/ba7a345ce5e85fb6b8591cd2d8c1ae69.webm?t=1780517996\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149080/extras/ba7a345ce5e85fb6b8591cd2d8c1ae69.mp4?t=1780517996\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">But wait, what are Ittzy<strong>'</strong>s friends cooking? </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0I<strong>'</strong>m not exactly sure, but if they don<strong>'</strong>t eat it maybe it can help you in taking on more difficult levels.   <br/><br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"300\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149080/extras/f74b319795f4092665e9eb1f376b6df7.avif?t=1780517996\" width=\"800\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Physics-fueled chaos that often produces funny or satisfying moments</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Carefully tuned, responsive player movement &amp; abilities</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Difficult platformer combat that rewards keen reactive use of the moveset</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Turn the enemies<strong>'\u00a0</strong>own moves and projectiles against them</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect upgrades along the way to take on more difficult levels</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Encounter challenge levels with special rules</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hand-animated, silly, cartoony creatures in an atmospheric environment</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Delicious smashy-crashy and punchy-crunchy effects</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Ittzy Fearless is a difficult physics-based action game. Play as Ittzy the fire spirit and use your swift moves and devastating strikes to tackle chaotic waves of enemies, projectiles and explosions.", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149080/39f1f3a52ed3b95cac804bd8c6e1bdd94c569c33/header.jpg?t=1780517996", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Platformer", "Difficult", "Cartoon", "Physics", "Side Scroller", "Cartoony"], "developers": "Marin's forest", "publishers": "Marin's forest", "release_date": "2026", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4149080", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "16